{'symbol': 'HAS', 'date': '2022-06-08 10:10:00', 'title': 'ALTA FOX ISSUES STATEMENT REGARDING OUTCOME OF ELECTION CONTEST AT HASBRO', 'text': "DALLAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ALTA FOX CAPITAL MANAGEMENT, LLC (TOGETHER WITH ITS AFFILIATES, “ALTA FOX” OR “WE”), THE BENEFICIAL OWNER OF APPROXIMATELY 2.5% OF THE OUTSTANDING SHARES OF HASBRO, INC. (NASDAQ: HAS) (“HASBRO” OR THE “COMPANY”), TODAY ISSUED THE FOLLOWING STATEMENT REGARDING ITS CAMPAIGN TO REFRESH THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS (THE “BOARD”) AT THE 2022 ANNUAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS (THE “ANNUAL MEETING”). CONNOR HALEY, MANAGING PARTNER OF ALTA FOX, COMMENTED: “WE THANK OUR FELLOW"}{'symbol': 'HAS', 'date': '2022-06-08 09:15:00', 'title': 'HASBRO SHAREHOLDERS RE-ELECT ALL DIRECTORS AT ANNUAL MEETING', 'text': "PAWTUCKET, R.I.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HASBRO, INC. (NASDAQ: HAS), A GLOBAL PLAY AND ENTERTAINMENT COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE PRELIMINARY RESULTS AT THE 2022 ANNUAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS, AS PROVIDED BY ITS PROXY SOLICITORS, WHICH INDICATE THAT HASBRO SHAREHOLDERS HAVE VOTED, WITH A SUBSTANTIAL MARGIN, TO RE-ELECT ALL 13 OF HASBRO'S HIGHLY QUALIFIED DIRECTORS TO THE HASBRO BOARD: RICHARD STODDART, KENNETH BRONFIN, MICHAEL BURNS, HOPE COCHRAN, CHRIS COCKS, LISA GERSH, ELIZABETH HAMREN, BLAKE JORG"}